    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the civil service law, the county law, the executive law and the general municipal law, in relation to making technical corrections thereto and the state fire mobilization and mutual aid plan (Part A); to amend the executive law, in relation to the acceptance of gifts by the state (Part B); and to amend the executive law, in relation to immunity from liability for emergency alerts (Part C)",
    "basePrintNo": "S5787",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5787-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
